Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先问模型一个问题：这张照片里是哪种奶酪？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is a question for a model: what cheese is in this photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:09.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,画面上的两个答案都来自 cli.py 里同一段预测代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both answers on screen come from the same predict code in cli.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且两个答案都说是 brie\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And both answers say brie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:13.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在数一数这些数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now count the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.26,0:00:16.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上面那个是 README 的输出，里面有三个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The top answer, the README output, holds three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:19.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下面那个来自这次录制，有四个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The bottom one, from this recording, holds four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:21.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个模型不可能给出两种结果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One model cannot give both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:25.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那么，endpoint 后面到底是哪个模型，还有些什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So which model is behind an endpoint, and what else is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:29.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 endpoint 后面有三样东西：一个产物，决定是哪个模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Behind an endpoint sit three pieces: an artifact, which model;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:31.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 container，决定用什么跑它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a container, what runs it;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:34.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一台机器，决定在哪里跑、谁来付钱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a machine, where it runs, and who pays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:38.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,机器旁边的计价器一直在走，哪怕一个请求都没来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The meter beside the machine keeps running while no request arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:42.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 2 部分，我们不再手动跑这些步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In part 2, we stop running these steps by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:48.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Cheese App 的四个阶段会变成一条 pipeline，由云端替你运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The four stages of the Cheese App become one pipeline that the cloud runs for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:54.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要跟着做，你需要：开通了结算的 AWS 账号、AWS CLI、Docker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To follow along, you need an AWS account with billing, the AWS CLI, Docker,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:56.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还要把两个 repo 都 clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and both repositories cloned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:00:59.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是我们第一次讲 AWS\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is our first lecture on AWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:02.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,角落里的进度条标出 README 的哪一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A tracker in the corner names the README step,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:05.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,黄色的 your turn 标签表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a yellow tag, your turn, means pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条命令也都写在学习指南里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every command is also in the study guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:11.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看这一讲的位置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, where this lecture sits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:14.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课程项目现在处于原型阶段\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The course project is in its prototype phase,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:18.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Cheese App 的四个部分里已经做完三个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and of the four parts of the Cheese App, three are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.46,0:01:20.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型部署还没做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Model deploy is still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:22.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个视频的第 1 部分填上这一格\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1 of this video fills that tile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:24.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 部分把四个全部连起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 connects all four.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:28.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上周，第 14 讲把 container 部署到了 Cloud Run 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last week, lecture 14 put containers on Cloud Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:31.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天，container 对外提供一个训练好的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today, the container serves a trained model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:35.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把控制台的各个部分和课程对应起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture maps its console onto the course:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,notebook、第 13 讲的训练\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}notebooks, training from lecture 13,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.52,0:01:40.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有今天的两项：在线预测和 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and today's two, online prediction and pipelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:44.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上讲的是 Google Cloud 上的 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture is written for Vertex AI on Google Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:51.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这门课也提供了两个教程的 AWS 版本，我们跟的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This course also ships an AWS version of both tutorials, and that is the one we follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,思路一样，名字不同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same ideas, different names.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每遇到一个，我都会指出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}I'll point out each one as we meet it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google Cloud 的 bucket 变成了 S3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A Google Cloud bucket becomes S3.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:01.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务账号的密钥变成了一个 IAM 用户\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A service account key becomes an IAM user
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.44,0:02:04.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥放在你的笔记本上，再加上云端的一个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a key on your laptop, plus a role in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:09.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 endpoint 变成了一份配置加上一个 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And an endpoint becomes a configuration plus an endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:13.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关于这次录制，有一点要说明：录制用的环境没有 AWS 账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One thing about this recording: it has no AWS account.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:16.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你笔记本上跑的每一步都是真的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every step that runs on your laptop is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:21.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 AWS 调用，都停在它遇到的第一个真实报错上，就像这个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every AWS call stops at its honest first error, like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:23.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,云端本来会回答的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Where the cloud would answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:26.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你看到的是 README 的输出，或者标好的本地替身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}you see the README output, or a tagged local stand-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,绝不假装成功\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Never a faked success.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:31.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时的版本都在画面上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Versions at the time of recording are on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:35.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：clone 这个 repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: clone the repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 写的是 clone 或者下载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says clone or download,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:40.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以我们的 git clone 是额外的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so our git clone is extra,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:43.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用来显示我们跟的那个 commit 的 git log 也是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and so is the git log that shows the commit we follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and clone it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:46.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外列一下目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra listing:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:51.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CLI、一个 Dockerfile、一个 Pipfile、八张示例照片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the CLI, a Dockerfile, a Pipfile, eight sample photos,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:54.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 docker-shell.sh，已经是可执行的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and docker-shell.sh, already executable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:57.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步和第 3 步在 AWS 控制台里做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 2 and 3 are in the AWS console.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:01.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,确认你能用 S3、SageMaker 和 IAM\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Check that you can use S3, SageMaker and IAM.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:06.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后创建一个 IAM 用户，叫 model-deployment，挂上三个策略\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then create an IAM user called model-deployment, with three policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:09.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三个策略的权限比这段代码需要的更宽\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The third is broader than this code needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.47,0:03:11.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,创建访问密钥，两个都存好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create access keys and save both.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:16.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步创建一个叫 SageMakerExecutionRole 的角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4 creates a role named SageMakerExecutionRole,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:20.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,信任 SageMaker，挂上 SageMaker 和 S3 的策略\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}trusted by SageMaker, with the SageMaker and S3 policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制它的 ARN\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy its ARN.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么要两个身份？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why two identities?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:27.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的笔记本用用户的密钥给每个请求签名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your laptop signs each request with the user key,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:31.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而你之后创建的 endpoint 以这个角色的身份运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the endpoint you create later acts as the role.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,密钥只留在你的笔记本上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The key stays on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:37.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步，然后暂停：用你自己起的名字建一个 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5, then pause: create a bucket with a name of your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:41.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 bucket 名在整个 AWS 里都是唯一的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because bucket names are unique across all of AWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:44.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只要里面放着文件，存储就在计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Storage bills while files sit in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且就像 README 提醒的，永远不要把密钥写进脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And as the README warns, never put keys in a script,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:49.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也永远不要把它们 commit 到 Git\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and never commit them to Git.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:53.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Run Container 的第 1 步：aws configure\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run Container, step 1: aws configure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着会出现四个提示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then come four prompts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:56.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你把两个密钥贴进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You paste your two keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:04:02.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们没有密钥，所以按两次 Enter，再输入 us-east-1 和 json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We have none, so we press Enter twice, then type us-east-1 and json.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:06.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外检查：只有 config 文件存在，因为我们没输入密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extras: only the config file exists, since we typed no keys,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:10.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,身份查询那一步也找不到凭据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and aws sts get-caller-identity cannot find credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用你的密钥，它会打印出你的账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your keys, it prints your account.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:14.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，让你的也打印出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and make yours print it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:18.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步还给了第二个选项：在你的 shell 里做三条 export\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 offers a second option: three exports in your shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:21.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,AWS 拒绝了我们的占位密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}AWS rejects our placeholder key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.10,0:04:23.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个更隐蔽的疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There is a subtler gap:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:28.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本只把区域、bucket 和角色传进 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the script passes only the region, the bucket and the role into the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:30.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 export 的密钥到墙那里就掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So exported keys fall off at the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用选项 1，或者用 -e 把密钥加进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Use option 1, or add the keys with -e.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:40.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：在 docker-shell.sh 里填上你的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: edit docker-shell.sh with your bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:43.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你那个角色的 ARN 和你的区域\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the ARN of your role, and your region.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:45.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的是占位符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours are placeholders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:48.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步，chmod，什么都不打印\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4, chmod, prints nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:52.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外列一下目录，可以看到脚本本来就是可执行的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra listing shows the script was already executable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:55.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:58.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它拉取 arm64 的基础 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It pulls the base image for arm64,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:05:02.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后停在第一行 RUN 上：exec format error\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then stops at the first RUN line: exec format error.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:06.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们这台 Intel 架构的笔记本运行不了那些程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our Intel style laptop cannot run those programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复就在脚本里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is in the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:11.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 19 行是给 Apple Silicon 的 Mac 用的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 19 is for Apple silicon Macs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:14.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 17 行被注释掉了，是普通的构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and line 17, commented out, is the plain build.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把两行对调：修复 1，额外的一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Swap them: fix 1, an extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:20.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Apple Silicon 上，原来那一行没问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On Apple silicon the original line works.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:23.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在别的机器上，它意味着很慢的模拟运行，或者这个报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Elsewhere it means slow emulation, or this error.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:25.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在看 Pipfile\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now look at the Pipfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:28.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,TensorFlow 被 pin 到一个版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}TensorFlow is pinned to one version,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:30.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可 SageMaker 写的是星号：任何版本都行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but SageMaker says "*": any version.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:34.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且没用 lock 文件：Git 忽略了 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And no lock is used: Git ignores the lock file,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:37.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Dockerfile 在构建时跑 pipenv lock\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the Dockerfile runs pipenv lock at build time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:43.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码写的时候是能用的，也没人改过一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The code worked when it was written, and nobody changed a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么今天 cli.py 在导入时就失败了？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why does cli.py fail at import today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:58.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,星号是约束，不是 pin，和第 1 讲一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}"*" is a constraint, not a pin, as in lecture 1:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:02.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解析器会选能装上的最新版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the resolver takes the newest release that installs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:08.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时，在 Python 3.9 上，那就是 SageMaker SDK 版本 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At the time of recording, on Python 3.9, that is SageMaker SDK version 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.83,0:06:11.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还带着 PyTorch 和 14 个 CUDA 包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with PyTorch and 14 CUDA packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:17.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,版本 3 是一个重写过的包，缺了 cli.py 导入的那些模块\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Version 3 is a rewritten package, without the modules cli.py imports:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:20.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有 tensorflow 模块、serializers\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no tensorflow module, no serializers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:22.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也没有 get execution role\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no get_execution_role.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,导入什么都找不到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The imports find nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:28.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，没 pin 的构建跑了 13 分钟，然后磁盘满了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, the unpinned build ran 13 minutes, then ran out of disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:33.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的笔记本上它会构建完成，然后在第一次导入时失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On your laptop it would finish, then fail at the first import.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.27,0:06:37.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复 2，也是额外的：把星号改成小于 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fix 2, also an extra: change "*" to "<3".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:41.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解析器停在最后一个版本 2 的发布版上，导入就正常了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The resolver stops at the last version 2 release, and the imports work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:43.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把两处修复都做好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and make both fixes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一次第 5 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run step 5 again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:51.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,将近 7 分钟构建完成，大部分时间在锁定依赖、安装包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It builds in almost 7 minutes, mostly locking and installing packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:56.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥，AWS 检查失败了，但 shell 还是打开了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The AWS check fails without keys, but the shell still opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:59.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,进去以后，额外检查显示 Python 3.9\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside, extras show Python 3.9,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:05.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SageMaker 版本 2 和 TensorFlow 2.18，还有脚本里的三个值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}SageMaker version 2 and TensorFlow 2.18, and the three values from the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:08.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,弃用警告不是问题所在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deprecation warnings are not the error.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:13.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：帮助文本里还写着 GCS bucket 和 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the help text still says GCS bucket and Vertex AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试参数也不起任何作用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the test flag does nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:18.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令都是 AWS 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The commands are the AWS ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:21.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 image 大约 4 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The image is about 4 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:26.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在准备模型之前，先看课上的一个设计问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before we prepare the model, a design question from the lecture:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:28.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预处理放在哪里做？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where does preprocessing happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:31.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 notebook 里，你一个单元格一个单元格地缩放、归一化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a notebook, you resize and normalize cell by cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:36.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,生产环境的 endpoint 应该接收原始照片，自己把这些都做完\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A production endpoint should take the raw photo and do all of that itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:39.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这个教程里，是客户端来做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In this tutorial, the client does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:48.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预测代码打开照片，转成 RGB，再缩放到 224 乘 224\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The predict code opens the photo, converts it to RGB and resizes it to 224 by 224.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:53.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后除以 255，把这些数字作为 JSON 发出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it divides by 255 and sends the numbers as JSON.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:58.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个额外检查读出了模型的前门，TensorFlow 管它叫签名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra check reads the model's front door, which TensorFlow calls a signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:03.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它接收浮点数，形状是任意数量乘 224 乘 224 乘 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It takes floats, shaped any number by 224 by 224 by 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:06.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每张照片给出四个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and gives four numbers per photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预处理在这条线上你这一边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Preprocessing sits on your side of the wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:13.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上点出了风险：客户端的脆弱性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture names the risk: client-side brittleness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:17.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个客户端都必须一模一样地重复这些步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every client must repeat those steps exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:22.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个忘了除以 255 的手机应用，会得到一个信心满满的错误答案\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a phone app that forgets to divide by 255 gets confident nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:27.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型里只放一份，也更容易回滚和做版本管理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One copy inside the model is also easier to roll back and version.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:30.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的修复在第 2 部分的训练脚本里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix from the lecture sits in the part 2 trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:36.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预处理函数把 JPEG 解码，转成浮点数，再缩放\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The preprocess function decodes the JPEG, converts it to floats, and resizes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:41.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个被标成模型前门的函数接收一批 JPEG 字符串\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A function marked as the model's front door takes a batch of JPEG strings,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:43.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,逐个处理，再调用模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}prepares each one, and calls the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它被保存为 serving default\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is saved as the serving_default.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:48.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入原始字节，每个类别输出一个分数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Raw bytes in, one score per class out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:50.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个坑要避开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One trap to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:55.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 说 prepare 这一步会把模型转成 SavedModel 格式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says the prepare step converts the model to the SavedModel format.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:09:00.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那是格式的变化，不是课上讲的签名的变化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is a change of format, not the change of signature from the lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:05.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：python cli.py --prepare\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: python cli.py --prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:07.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 列了四件事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README lists four things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:10.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 GitHub 下载模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Download the model from GitHub,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.01,0:09:14.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,转成 SavedModel 格式，打包成 model.tar.gz\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}convert it to the SavedModel format, pack it as model.tar.gz,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.69,0:09:16.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再上传到你的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and upload it to your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:20.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些是课上部署图里的第 1 步和第 3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those are steps 1 and 3 of the lecture deployment picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:24.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步，也就是签名的变化，不在第 1 部分里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2, the signature change, is not in part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:29.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的马上就停了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours stops right away:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:34.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有凭据，在 cli.py 第 73 行，那一行创建 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no credentials, at line 73 of cli.py, which creates the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:39.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且 artifacts 目录不存在，所以什么都没下载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the artifacts folder does not exist, so nothing was downloaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:41.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 里有一个小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small gap in the README:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:47.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码先创建 bucket，再下载东西，清单里没提这一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the code creates the bucket before it downloads anything, a step the list does not mention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:52.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有你的密钥时，它会创建 bucket，如果已经存在，就复用你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your keys, it creates the bucket, or reuses yours if it already exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为了展示接下来的事，做一个额外实验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To show what comes next, an extra:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:59.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一个 prepare 函数，把 S3 换成一个什么都不发送的 stub\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same prepare function, with S3 replaced by a stub that sends nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:05.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,release 的 zip 包下载下来，模型导出了，而 stub 拦下了上传\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The release zip downloads, the model is exported, and the stub stops the upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:07.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都没到达 AWS\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing reaches AWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来看它生成了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is what it made.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:11.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SavedModel 是一个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A SavedModel is a folder:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:15.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,计算图和有名字的入口，在 saved model 那个 pb 文件里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the graph and its named entry points in saved_model.pb,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:18.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,权重在 variables 目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the weights in a variables folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码把它放在一个叫 1 的目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The code puts it in a folder named 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:25.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 TensorFlow Serving 先按名字、再按版本找模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because TensorFlow Serving finds models by name, then version.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:27.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 tar 包里，顶层就是这个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tarball holds that folder at its top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:31.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一个 git status，能看到你的两处改动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra git status shows your two edits,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Git 也忽略了 artifacts 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Git ignores the artifacts folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:37.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的账号里，tar 包现在放在 S3 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In your account, the tarball now sits in S3,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:39.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只要它存在，存储就在计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and storage bills while it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:43.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：deploy\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.74,0:10:45.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还记得开头那三样东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember the three pieces from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:49.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在代码里，它先描述一个 TensorFlow 模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In code, it first describes a TensorFlow model:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:53.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,S3 里的 tar 包、负责推理的 container，再加上角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the tarball in S3 and the serving container, plus the role.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:56.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这时 AWS 里还什么都没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing exists in AWS yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:58.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上在这里把模型上传到模型注册表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture uploads to a model registry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:01.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两份 README 也都写着模型注册表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both READMEs say model registry too,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:05.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但代码只在 SageMaker 里建了一个普通的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the code creates a plain model in SageMaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:07.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你不用自己写 image 名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You never write an image name:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:11.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SDK 会选出 AWS 的 TensorFlow Serving image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the SDK picks the AWS TensorFlow Serving image
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:14.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,依据是框架版本 2.13\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from framework version 2.13.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:17.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的模型是用 TensorFlow 2.18 导出的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our model was exported by TensorFlow 2.18.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:22.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 3 步，一个本地检查会显示 Serving 2.13 能加载它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In step 3, a local check shows that Serving 2.13 loads it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:29.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 deploy，实例是一台 ml.m5.xlarge，名字带时间戳\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then deploy, with one instance of type ml.m5.xlarge, under a name with a timestamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:33.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一次调用就创建了全部三样：SageMaker 里的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That one call creates all three: the model in SageMaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:38.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一份 endpoint 配置，写明用哪台机器、哪个模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an endpoint configuration, which names the machine and the model,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:40.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 endpoint，也就是你要调用的地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the endpoint, the address you call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:44.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑 python cli.py --deploy\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run python cli.py --deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:50.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的停在第 168 行，也就是 deploy 调用：没有凭据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours stops at line 168, the deploy call: no credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:53.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用你的密钥，README 说要 5 到 10 分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With yours, the README says 5 to 10 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:56.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后打印出 endpoint 名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then it prints the endpoint name
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:58.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并保存到 endpoint config 那个 JSON 文件里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and saves it in endpoint_config.json.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:02.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把这个叫 serverless，意思是不用你管服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture calls this serverless, meaning no server for you to manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:07.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它仍然是一台机器，全天候在计费，哪怕流量是零\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is still one machine, billing around the clock, even with zero traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:11.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和第 14 讲的 Cloud Run 不同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Unlike Cloud Run in lecture 14, this endpoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:15.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照代码这样创建的 endpoint 不会缩容到零\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as the code creates it, does not scale to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:17.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上比较了两种部署方式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture compares two ways to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:21.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型 endpoint 直接部署训练好的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A model endpoint deploys a trained model directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:24.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,版本管理、A/B 测试和监控都现成可用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with versioning, A/B testing and monitoring available.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:30.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Cloud Run 这类通用 container 服务，什么都能跑，其余自己搭\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A general container service like Cloud Run runs anything, and you build the rest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:34.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的经验法则：要部署训练好的模型，就用 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its rule of thumb: an endpoint to serve a trained model,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:38.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型只是更大应用的一部分时，用 container 服务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a container service when the model is one part of a larger app.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:40.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，这些功能都没用上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, those features go unused.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:45.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：python cli.py --predict\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: python cli.py --predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:48.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没找到 endpoint config 那个 JSON 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours finds no endpoint_config.json
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.92,0:12:51.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的就退回到一个默认名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and falls back to a default name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:56.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它挑了五张照片，失败了五次：Unable to locate credentials\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It picks five photos and fails five times: Unable to locate credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:13:00.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次尝试会发送一张照片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each try would send one photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:07.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,客户端把它缩放到 224 乘 224，有 3 个颜色通道\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The client resizes it to 224 by 224, with 3 color channels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:10.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为了这一张照片，有多少个数字要传到 endpoint？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How many numbers travel to the endpoint for that one photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.83,0:13:27.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,224 乘 224 乘 3：150528 个浮点数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}224 times 224 times 3: 150,528 floats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:32.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Python 把每一个都写成 JSON 里的文本，所以每张照片有好几 MB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Python writes each one as text in JSON, so a few megabytes per photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:36.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个接收字节的签名，会直接发送 JPEG 本身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A signature that takes bytes would send the JPEG itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:39.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案是一个包含四个概率的列表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answer is a list of four probabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:43.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码用 argmax 取最大的那个，再去查表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The code takes the largest with argmax and looks it up:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:47.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,0 是 parmigiano，1 是 gruyere，2 是 brie，3 是 gouda\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}0 parmigiano, 1 gruyere, 2 brie, 3 gouda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:48.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为了看到真实的回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To see a real answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:52.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们用一个额外的本地替身，不是 SageMaker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}we use an extra local stand-in, not SageMaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:56.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,AWS 的推理 image 里跑的是 TensorFlow Serving\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The AWS serving image runs TensorFlow Serving,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:14:01.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以我们在导出的模型上启动了公开的 Serving 2.13 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so we started the public Serving 2.13 image on our export.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:02.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它加载了版本 1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It loads version 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:06.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后同一个预测函数把同样的 JSON 发给它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the same predict function sends the same JSON to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:08.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照片是 brie，回来的就是 brie\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Brie comes back brie,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:11.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照片是 gruyere，回来的就是 gruyere，每次都是四个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and gruyere comes back gruyere, four numbers each.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:15.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 parmigiano 回来的是 brie，98%\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And parmigiano comes back brie, at 98 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:18.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是发布出来的模型真实犯下的错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is a real mistake of the released model.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:22.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它自己的指标文件写的准确率大约是 72%\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its own metrics file reports about 72 percent accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.10,0:14:24.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在回到开头的谜题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the opening puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:29.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码一样，产物不同：README 的输出来自一个更旧的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same code, different artifact: the README output came from an older model,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:32.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有三个类别，label 顺序也不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with three classes and another label order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:37.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：你应该看到四个数，而且索引 0 是 parmigiano\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small gap: expect four numbers, and index 0 is parmigiano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:40.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条额外的命令删掉了这个替身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra command removes the stand-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:42.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它从没碰过 AWS\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It never touched AWS.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:47.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上提醒，endpoint 只要开着就在花钱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture warns that an endpoint costs money while it is up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:49.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件上就喊了一个词：删除\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the slides shout one word: delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:51.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 给了三种方式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README gives three ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:56.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪一种都能停掉 endpoint，但只有第三种还会删掉 tar 包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Any one stops the endpoint, but only the third also removes the tarball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:15:01.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,方式 1，控制台：SageMaker、Endpoints，选中你的，点 Delete\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Way 1, the console: SageMaker, Endpoints, select yours, Delete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:04.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,方式 2 给了三条 AWS CLI 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Way 2 gives three AWS CLI commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:08.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照着原样输入，第一条就是一个 shell 报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Typed exactly as written, the first one is a shell error:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:13.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,尖括号是占位符，shell 把它们当成了重定向\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the angle brackets are placeholders, and the shell takes them as a redirection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:16.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：输入你自己的名字，不带尖括号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small gap: type your own names, without brackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:19.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样改了以后，我们的还是失败了：没有凭据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours then fails: no credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:24.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按这个顺序删：先 endpoint，再它的配置，最后是模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete in this order: the endpoint, then its configuration, then the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:27.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,方式 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Way 3:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:32.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,python cli.py --delete 停在它的第一个 SageMaker 调用上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}python cli.py --delete stops at its first SageMaker call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:34.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:38.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它删除 JSON 文件里记着的那个 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it deletes the endpoint named in the JSON file.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:45.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后按命名约定删掉匹配的配置和模型，最后是 S3 里的 tar 包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then come matching configurations and the model, by naming convention, then the tarball in S3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:49.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次 deploy 都会建一个新 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each deploy makes a new endpoint with a new timestamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,时间戳也是新的，可 JSON 文件只记着最后一个名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the JSON file keeps only the last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你跑了两次 deploy，然后跑了一次 delete\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You ran deploy twice, then delete once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:56.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有几个 endpoint 在计费？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How many endpoints still bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:07.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个。这次 delete 只删掉文件里记着的那个 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One. Delete removes only the endpoint the file names.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:09.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,更早的那个还在运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The older one keeps running.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:14.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 aws sagemaker list-endpoints 检查，再到控制台确认\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Check with aws sagemaker list-endpoints, and confirm in the console.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:16.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是第 1 部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:19.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你手动跑了四条命令，部署了一个模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You ran four commands by hand to deploy one model.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.11,0:16:22.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这之前，Cheese App 还有四个阶段\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Cheese App has four stages before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:26.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,谁来把它们全部跑完，按正确的顺序，每一次都这样？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Who runs all of them, in the right order, every time?
